 ### Edge cases and pitfalls
-*   **Precision**: High-dimensional feature vectors (512) increase memory usage. Using a compressed dimension (128) requires a decoder network, which must be optimized separately [S2].
+*   **Precision**: High-dimensional feature vectors (512) increase memory usage [S2]. Using a compressed dimension (128) requires a decoder network, which must be optimized separately [S2].
